Porelo OpenAPI Templates

Every template under org/fuin/porelo/forge/openapi/templates/ is a copy of the template of the same name in
OpenAPI Generator's JavaSpring templates (https://github.com/OpenAPITools/openapi-generator), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, at the release named in OpenApiTemplates.GENERATOR_VERSION. Each copy was changed:
Spring's and Jakarta's annotations are left out, required fields are checked, and values that can be null are
marked for NullAway.

